    f: [['How should a reusable button report taps?', 'Through a callback parameter supplied by the parent', 'By editing a global variable', 'By calling setState on its parent', 'By printing'], ['What does "lifting state up" mean?', 'Moving state to a common ancestor and passing it down', 'Storing state in the cloud', 'Using a higher Flutter version', 'Making all widgets stateful']],
