    u: 'Reorderable lists, dismissible items, animated lists, preserving form field state.',
    n: "Don't add UniqueKey in build — it discards state on every rebuild.",
    p: 'Correct state preservation.',
    x: 'Overusing GlobalKey is costly and couples code.',
    r: 'Swipe-to-delete list items with Dismissible(key: ValueKey(item.id)).',
